sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: If two similar plane numbers multiplied by one another make some number, then the product is square.
----
proof:

Let {A} and {B} be two similar plane numbers, and let {A} multiplied by {B} make {C}.

I say that {C} is square.

Multiply {A} by itself to make {D}. Then {D} is square.

